  "title": {
   "en": "Otonari-kun wa Kyou mo Watashi wo Komaraseru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "おとなりくんは今日もわたしを困らせる"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Otonarikun ha kyou mowatashi wo komaraseru"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Boy Next to Me is Troubling Me Again Today"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Minato, a worry-prone high school girl, finds herself seated next to Mineichi—tall, intimidating, and downright scary… or so she thinks. At first, every day is filled with anxiety, but as time goes on, she realizes he’s not so scary after all. In fact, he’s making her heart race in a whole different way—how troublesome!\n\nA clumsy yet endearing rom-com between an anxious girl and an easygoing guy begins! ♡",
   "ja": "心配性な女子高生のミオンは入学早々、デカくて怖いホーイチの隣の席になってしまう。おびえる日々を過ごすミオンだけど、だんだんホーイチは怖くはないと気がついて…。\nむしろドキドキさせてきて、困るのですが！？\n\n心配性女子×ノーテンキ男子の噛み合わないけど愛おしいドタバタラブコメ開幕♡"
  },
